null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-10-15T16:56:26Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T14:11:45Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5.stable.mono\n4.5.1.stable.mono\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8142) - Intel(R) Core(TM) Ultra 9 285K (24 threads) - 63.37 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf a C# project has any scripts that extend EditorScript, exports will fail with an error like: \n\n<img width=\"567\" height=\"106\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0f5957a7-0c30-47c6-99b4-f6608dcf43a0\" />\n\nWith MSBuild error:\n```\nCS0246: The type or namespace name 'EditorScript' could not be found (are you missing a using directive or an assembly reference?) C:\\Users\\Firebelley\\Desktop\\mrp\\EditorToolExample.cs(5,42)\n```\n\nI should note that I am using .NET 9 in case that information is useful.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a C# project\n2. Create a C# class extending EditorScript\n3. Attempt to export for any platform\n4. Observe failure\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22932436/mrp.zip)\n\nReally all that you need is an EditorScript like:\n\n```cs\nusing Godot;\n\n[Tool]\n[GlobalClass]\npublic partial class EditorToolExample : EditorScript\n{\n\tpublic override void _Run()\n\t{\n\t\tGD.Print(\"Hello world!\");\n\t}\n}\n```","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111683/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111683/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}